  "title": "Land the v2 record chain plane behind red_evidence_quarantine and red_evidence_recover",
  "description": "Third implementation leaf (W2c) of the trusted RED-evidence subsystem spec. Implement the proofstory.red_evidence.v2 record union (§1.10 per-operation field sets, §0.4 nullability, recordDigest = CANON minus recordDigest), widen RedEvidenceData to a mixed v1/v2 records array, and — in the SAME commit — guard the existing v1 predicate redEvidenceRecordSatisfied to skip non-v1 records so a v2 record does not crash the LIVE enforce gate. Implement the chain plane (partition by (storyId,acceptanceTargetRef); §3.2 head uniqueness; the three §3.3 integrity checks with fork rejection as an independent store-corruption detector; the closed transition table with transitive cycle-safe effective-head resolution; the §3.4 operation-key preimages + deterministic record id; the §3.5 dedupe ordering; one-mkdir-claim serialization of the whole append) and land red_evidence_quarantine + red_evidence_recover (reusing W2b's proven wiring recipe) with derived approvedBy and the §1.1.3 binding-freeze rule.",
